## Demo

**Project demonstration:** [Watch the LeadZam Click-to-Call demo](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oWexE2CufBfvGUT_wlE4PeW28L5hzglN/view?usp=sharing)

The demonstration covers:
- Selecting a lead and Android device in the web dashboard.
- Sending a call request through the backend and Firebase Cloud Messaging.
- Receiving the request on Android and opening the native dialer with the number prefilled.
- Dismiss actions and request acknowledgement status.
- System architecture, error handling, and known limitations.
